WEBVTT

00:19:00.163 --> 00:19:01.413
Now, some of them are not good,

00:19:01.413 --> 00:19:04.413
but there are many indie pretentious
movies that are not good either.

00:19:04.454 --> 00:19:07.996
So what I would say is, is look
for things that you love.

00:19:08.163 --> 00:19:11.663
And if you loved that thing right,
if you love Black Panther,

00:19:12.121 --> 00:19:15.038
maybe check out Creed by the same director
, Ryan Coogler.

00:19:15.246 --> 00:19:20.163
And if you love Creed, maybe check out
Fruitvale Station also by that director.

00:19:20.371 --> 00:19:24.954
You know, if you loved Thor Ragnarok,
there's a reason Tycho Waititi, right.

00:19:24.954 --> 00:19:29.996
An indigenous New Zealander,
got the job for Thor.